--- !u!114 &8446843179058813852
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 981124074798637499}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8f833cb3236df3b48bc179e552c3ca5f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  taskData:
  - taskType: 0
    taskDialogueSequences:
    - dialogueLines:
      - "Show me you can bring it back without eating it first. Then we\u2019ll talk."
    - dialogueLines:
      - If you can survive out there and come back with it, I might believe you can
        keep me safe.
    - dialogueLines:
      - Consider this your apocalypse audition. Impress me.
    - dialogueLines:
      - "Deliver this and maybe I\u2019ll believe you\u2019re not just another bunkerless
        fool."
    - dialogueLines:
      - "Let\u2019s play a little game of fetch. The stakes? My eternal trust."
    todoTaskTexts:
    - '{npcName} wants you to deliver a specific item to earn their trust.'
    - '{npcName} asks you to bring them something important.'
    - "{npcName} asks you to bring them something specific they\u2019re waiting on."
    - '{npcName} is expecting you to drop off something important.'
    - '{npcName} is expecting you to drop off something important.'
  - taskType: 1
    taskDialogueSequences:
    - dialogueLines:
      - If you want me on your team, show me you can hammer with purpose.
    - dialogueLines:
      - "Bang it. Hard. That\u2019s how my uncle fixed everything."
    - dialogueLines:
      - "I started repairs but\u2026 I got distracted by... you know... current events."
    - dialogueLines:
      - "Look, I know it\u2019s the end of the world, but aesthetics matter. Go tidy
        that up."
    todoTaskTexts:
    - '{npcName} needs your help repairing a damaged object nearby.'
    - '{npcName} wants you to ensure something holds together for just a little longer.'
  - taskType: 2
    taskDialogueSequences:
    - dialogueLines:
      - Bust a move or bust your chances. Your call.
    - dialogueLines:
      - One dance. No judgment. Maybe.
    - dialogueLines:
      - The floor is yours. Impress me.
    - dialogueLines:
      - "If you can\u2019t move your body, how can I trust you with my life?"
    - dialogueLines:
      - Back in the day, we settled this with dance-offs. Tradition matters.
    - dialogueLines:
      - Only those with rhythm survive...
    todoTaskTexts:
    - '{npcName} challenges you to prove yourself through dance.'
    - '{npcName} wants to see your moves before trusting you.'
    - '{npcName} is testing your spirit through a dance challenge.'
  - taskType: 3
    taskDialogueSequences:
    - dialogueLines:
      - Sometimes, I need a reminder that pain is real. Swing away.
    - dialogueLines:
      - Give me your best hit. I can take it. Probably.
    - dialogueLines:
      - "This is part of the trust exercise. Don\u2019t ask why."
    - dialogueLines:
      - "It\u2019s not weird if we both agree to it, right?"
    - dialogueLines:
      - "I\u2019ve been through worse. But not by you. Let\u2019s fix that."
    - dialogueLines:
      - "This is how I bond with people. Don\u2019t hold back."
    - dialogueLines:
      - Ever rage-quit a game? Yeah, channel that. On me.
    todoTaskTexts:
    - '{npcName} wants you to strike them with a crowbar to complete the task.'
    - '{npcName} asks you to hit them with a crowbar to build trust.'
  - taskType: 4
    taskDialogueSequences:
    - dialogueLines:
      - "Trust me, in this world, it\u2019s not what you know. It\u2019s who you
        trick."
    - dialogueLines:
      - "Convince them you\u2019re smarter than you are. Should be easy."
    - dialogueLines:
      - "The world\u2019s ending. Might as well go out with a fake PhD."
    todoTaskTexts:
    - i dont know if this should be a task
